in real life.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Welcome to U-M Fencing!</title><link>https://www.um-fencing.com/welcome/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jan 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.um-fencing.com/welcome/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the University of Michigan Fencing team!
Whether you&amp;rsquo;re a new or returning member, we look forward to having you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This page will be helpful to you in (re)joining the club, receiving all important information throughout the year, and getting to know your teammates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="becoming-a-member"&gt;Becoming a Member&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please follow these steps to become a member of the club this term. &lt;em&gt;All members, including those returning, must complete these annually!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Add Our Calendar</title><link>https://www.um-fencing.com/add_calendar/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Aug 2016 15:35:56 -0400</pubDate><guid>https://www.um-fencing.com/add_calendar/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="to-add-the-umfc-calendar-to-google-calendar"&gt;To add the UMFC calendar to Google Calendar:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visit &lt;a target="_blank" href="https://calendar.googe.com"&gt;Google Calendar&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click on the arrow next to &amp;ldquo;Other Calendars.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select &amp;ldquo;Add a friend&amp;rsquo;s calendar.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paste in &lt;pre&gt;&lt;a href="mailto:c_bb23ea3e1dc4d5534b53566ba5955e9bf051104f80de5bc1cb14a5595e6bbbf1@group.calendar.google.com"&gt;c_bb23ea3e1dc4d5534b53566ba5955e9bf051104f80de5bc1cb14a5595e6bbbf1@group.calendar.google.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
